# A leftover copy of the one song the card used to play, kept beside the package.
# Nothing reads it; the card streams the station's own songs.
#
# Named to that one directory rather than to `assets/` at large. A blanket rule
# here once swallowed the rail's chevron SVGs whole: not in git, not in the
# published tarball, and nothing in the tree said they had ever existed.
packages/omaseek-music/assets/music/
